ble class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue3533\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 3533</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td>the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span></code> overload of <code>base</code> returns a copy of the underlying iterator\n</td>\n<td>returns a reference\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue3593\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 3593</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td>the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span></code> overload of <code>base</code> might not be noexcept\n</td>\n<td>made noexcept\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/transform_view","title":"std::ranges::views::transform, std::ranges::transform_view"},{"path":"ranges/transform_view/iterator","title":"std::ranges::transform_view<V,F>::iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::transform_view<V,F>::iterator<Const>::base","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Returns the underlying iterator."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A reference to the underlying iterator."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":190,"codeBlockCount":2}
